  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When attempting to type a url into a VRC URL Input Field, colons (` : `) are omitted amongst other characters.\nThis prevents the input of urls; i.e. \"`https://` becomes \"`https//`\", making the URL invalid.\n**This is also present in the Live SDK**.\nAdditionally, *in testing [Quest]*, **sending the OK button does not fire the** `On End Edit` **event.** — In the Editor, the invalid URL is parsed, stopping existing video, and throwing an error that the video cannot be played.\n**In client, the video continues to play, as if the URL has not been parsed.**\n —\n# Related Feedback\n- [Add a way to press Enter to the Keyboard](https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1220-add-a-way-to-press-enter-to-the-keyboard)",
